# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) to run the app on a Supabase project instead of the local data store.
# Set both or neither. The anon key is public by design; row-level security protects the data.
# Local Supabase (npx supabase start) prints these two values.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
